~ statue
Statue: {{Campaign.fight_review()}}
- What are you?
	Statue: A critic. Someone has to be. I was carved for it.
- Any advice?
	Statue: Stand still. It has worked for me for three hundred years.
- Nothing.
=> END

~ bin
if Campaign.flag("bin_errand_done")
	Bin: You brought me something shiny once. I think about it daily.
	=> END
if Campaign.party_carries("shiny_button")
	Bin: Is that... a button? A shiny one? Give it here.
	- Give the button
		do Campaign.hand_over_item("shiny_button")
		do Campaign.give_item(Campaign.leader(), "childs_shoe")
		do Campaign.set_flag("bin_errand_done")
		Bin: Marvellous. Take this, then. I found it. I find a lot of things. That is the job.
	- Keep it
		Bin: Fine. I will remember this. I remember everything. It is all in here.
	=> END
Bin: People put things in me without asking. Rude.
- What do you want?
	Bin: Something shiny. A button, a coin. There was one by the well, if the rain has not had it.
- Sorry.
	Bin: You are forgiven. Partly.
=> END

~ lamp_post
Lamp post: {{Campaign.remembered_line("lamp_post")}}
=> END
